#FCW: Forward Collision Warning
#LKAS: Lane-Keeping Assistance System
#
#This ACC example is unique to ACC testing in the Euro NCAP spec. It involves a vehicle starting in the same lane as the ego, then leaving the lane to avoid a stopped vehicle
